        "created_at": "2014-02-23T13:48:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>Hi everyone.&nbsp;</div><div>I've been playing Sentinels for a few months now and loving it! My gaming group doesn't get together very frequently so I mostly play solo and don't have anyone to bounce rules queries off very often.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>With Bunker's turret mode. Does the prohibition against playing/drawing cards only apply to his play/draw phases? What if he uses Initialise in his power phase or another hero let's him play/draw a card out of his usual turn? Does turret mode override all these or do these override turret mode?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The other one I've pondered is DW Mr Fixer's bitter strike. The two sentences on the power are separate and one doesn't seem to key off of the other. What happens if the power is used and there are no ongoing/equipment cards in play? The way it's written you resolve the damage first and the destroy second, so don't check if there is anything there to destroy before he punches, but that seems to go against the flavour of the power.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Thanks and sorry if these have been answered before - there a lot of post history here!</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:30.874Z",
