        "raw": "<div>Hi everyone.&nbsp;</div><div>I&#39;ve been playing Sentinels for a few months now and loving it! My gaming group doesn&#39;t get together very frequently so I mostly play solo and don&#39;t have anyone to bounce rules queries off very often.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>With Bunker&#39;s turret mode. Does the prohibition against playing/drawing cards only apply to his play/draw phases? What if he uses Initialise in his power phase or another hero let&#39;s him play/draw a card out of his usual turn? Does turret mode override all these or do these override turret mode?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The other one I&#39;ve pondered is DW Mr Fixer&#39;s bitter strike. The two sentences on the power are separate and one doesn&#39;t seem to key off of the other. What happens if the power is used and there are no ongoing/equipment cards in play? The way it&#39;s written you resolve the damage first and the destroy second, so don&#39;t check if there is anything there to destroy before he punches, but that seems to go against the flavour of the power.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Thanks and sorry if these have been answered before - there a lot of post history here!</div>",
