        "id": 93290,
        "name": "Oaktree",
        "username": "Oaktree",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-23T14:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cannot overrides can.&nbsp; So for Bunker the playing/drawing prohibition is in force unless there is a specific phrase allowing it as an exception.&nbsp; The main exception being the text of the Ammo Drop card.&nbsp; There is also text on cards that say \"reveal and put into play\" (such as Omnitron-X's default power) that I believe would allow Bunker to get another card into play while Turret Mode is in operation.</p><p>For Fixer it has been previously discussed that equipment does not *have* to be present in order for Bitter Strike to be used.</p><p>Edit: Ninja-ed.&nbsp; Of course.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:19:28.564Z",
