        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Cannot overrides can.&nbsp; So for Bunker the playing/drawing prohibition is in force unless there is a specific phrase allowing it as an exception.&nbsp; The main exception being the text of the Ammo Drop card.&nbsp; There is also text on cards that say &quot;reveal and put into play&quot; (such as Omnitron-X&#39;s default power) that I believe would allow Bunker to get another card into play while Turret Mode is in operation.</p><p>For Fixer it has been previously discussed that equipment does not *have* to be present in order for Bitter Strike to be used.</p><p>Edit: Ninja-ed.&nbsp; Of course.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
