        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MightySi\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/48/2168_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MightySi:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks guys, looks like I owe the Chairman a rematch then, Bunker didn't legally help me beat him yesterday! Bloody Knuckles worked nicely tho. DW Fixer is certainly a heavy hitter than his regular counterpart.&nbsp;The G+ stuff sounds interesting! I wish to know more! &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/communities/117769941955241654989\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels of the Multiverse on Google Plus</a></p>\n<p>And lo, the supplicant's prayers were heard and answered.</p>",
